window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A sizzling contemporary BWWM romance about a professor, a secret pregnancy, and a rich playboy Mafia billionaire living a double life.</p> <p>In \"Deadly intimacy,\" the third and final book in the Dangerous Love trilogy, Michael is now aware that he has a son who was hidden from him, and he must come to terms with this newfound revelation. But things get even more complicated when he discovers that his love interest, Viola, is working with the FBI to hunt him down.</p> <p>While Michael and Viola struggle to sort through their differences and reconcile their past, a new enemy emerges in the form of Fabio. Fabio, the powerful and ruthless Mafia head, is not pleased with Michael's insubordination and decides to teach him a lesson. But unfortunately for Michael, Viola gets caught in the crossfire as well.</p> <p>With the odds stacked against them, Michael and Viola must fight to survive and protect their loved ones. But as they navigate this dangerous world, they must also confront the question of whether their love for each other is strong enough to overcome their past failures. Will they be able to overcome the challenges thrown their way and come out victorious, or will their love ultimately be their undoing? You'll have to listen to find out in this thrilling conclusion to the trilogy.</p>"; 
